{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CfWL38L2WAVEfZcXoxpzy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The deliverable is written to `/app/recipe.json` and the task is complete.\n\n**Recipe for the next run (batch 512, 384B tokens):** lr = 0.0007, wd = 0.0312, expected loss interval [2.5448, 2.5557].\n\n**How I got there** (46 lab calls, 220.5 of 224 credits):\n\n- **lr optimum scaling.** Learning-rate sweeps at 3B, 12B, 48B and 96B tokens for both batch sizes gave a very clean law: optimal lr ∝ steps^-0.32 · batch^0.42, with a stable curvature of about 0.10 per (ln lr)². Fit residuals were ~2% in lr*. This predicts lr* ≈ 0.00069–0.00071 at the target, so I used 0.0007. A 96B/batch-512 pair placed at ±25% around the prediction landed almost symmetrically, confirming the law one step short of the target.\n- **wd optimum scaling.** Weight decay only matters through the product lr·wd·steps (the decoupled-decay timescale). The optimal product was ≈3.9 at 48B/256 and ≈3.8 at 96B/512, two setups with the same step count but different tokens and batch, which rules out a token-based rule. The 12B estimates sat lower (~2.7) but with wide error bars because wd barely matters at short runs. I chose a product of 4.0, which keeps a constant-product rule inside the 0.0008 tolerance while allowing a mild upward drift.\n- **Curvature caveat.** The wd curvature grows quickly with run length (0.002 at 12B, 0.007 at 48B, 0.024 at 96B), so at 384B the recipe's wd likely needs to be within roughly 10% of optimal. That is the main residual risk on the recipe item. The lr side is within a few percent.\n- **Loss interval.** One full-scale seed at the chosen recipe measured 2.55025. Loss-versus-tokens extrapolation was not reliable enough to tighten this, so the interval is the measurement ±0.0055, which is 3.4 seed standard deviations on each side and uses the full permitted width.\n\nAll run records are in `/app/work/results.jsonl` and the fitting scripts in `/app/work/`."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":462,"cache_read_input_tokens":82250,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":462,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":758,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8b495447-6df3-4324-9d0b-2b4188d8b30b","uuid":"3a68c534-e7cd-4313-8f47-8b35ba22c8c9","timestamp":"2026-09-28T18:42:29.053Z"}
